2
00:11:53,333 --> 00:11:59,333
Ron's Gone Wrong is a animation, science fiction,
family film directed by Sarah Smith.

3
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:56,000
In a world where walking, talking, digitally connected bots have become children's best friends, an
11-year-old finds that his robot buddy doesn't quite work the same as the others do.

4
00:23:46,666 --> 00:23:52,666
Barney (voice), played by Jack Dylan Grazer.

5
00:29:43,333 --> 00:29:49,333
Ron (voice), played by Zach Galifianakis.

6
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:46,000
Graham (voice), played by Ed Helms.

7
00:41:36,666 --> 00:41:42,666
Donka (voice), played by Olivia Colman.

8
00:47:33,333 --> 00:47:39,333
